#ASSERT `Can the estate recover these damages` TRUE TRUE TRUE `bodily or mental harm the person suffered` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the estate recover these damages` TRUE TRUE TRUE `curtailment of the person's expectation of life` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the estate recover these damages` TRUE TRUE FALSE `the person's pain or suffering` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can the estate recover these damages` TRUE FALSE TRUE `the person's pain or suffering` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can the estate recover these damages` FALSE TRUE TRUE `the person's pain or suffering` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can the estate recover these damages` TRUE TRUE TRUE `some other head of damages` EQUALS NOTHING

