§§ `s 19 -- appearance and fees`

#ASSERT `Can this person appear for me` `I appear myself` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can this person appear for me` `an Australian legal practitioner appears for me` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can this person appear for me` `someone who is not an Australian legal practitioner appears for me` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can this person appear for me` `someone who is not an Australian legal practitioner appears for me` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

#ASSERT `Can my representative charge a fee` `an Australian legal practitioner representing me` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can my representative charge a fee` `someone else representing me` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 20(6) -- conduct money`

-- Issued Monday 2 November 2026, to be complied with on Monday 30 November (28 days); a reasonable time of 7 days
-- leaves 21 days: the tender must be made by Monday 23 November. Conduct money prescribed: $100.
-- Arguments: my request; issued; compliance; reasonable days; prescribed; tendered; amount; day tendered.
#ASSERT `Must the person I subpoenaed comply` TRUE (`the date` 2 11 2026) (`the date` 30 11 2026) 7 100 TRUE 100 (`the date` 10 11 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The last day, 23 November, with exactly the prescribed amount.
#ASSERT `Must the person I subpoenaed comply` TRUE (`the date` 2 11 2026) (`the date` 30 11 2026) 7 100 TRUE 100 (`the date` 23 11 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The day after, 24 November: too late.
#ASSERT `Must the person I subpoenaed comply` TRUE (`the date` 2 11 2026) (`the date` 30 11 2026) 7 100 TRUE 100 (`the date` 24 11 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- In time, a dollar short.
#ASSERT `Must the person I subpoenaed comply` TRUE (`the date` 2 11 2026) (`the date` 30 11 2026) 7 100 TRUE 99 (`the date` 10 11 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- In time, more than prescribed.
#ASSERT `Must the person I subpoenaed comply` TRUE (`the date` 2 11 2026) (`the date` 30 11 2026) 7 100 TRUE 150 (`the date` 10 11 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Tendered on the day of issue.
#ASSERT `Must the person I subpoenaed comply` TRUE (`the date` 2 11 2026) (`the date` 30 11 2026) 7 100 TRUE 100 (`the date` 2 11 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Nothing tendered.
#ASSERT `Must the person I subpoenaed comply` TRUE (`the date` 2 11 2026) (`the date` 30 11 2026) 7 100 FALSE 0 (`the date` 2 11 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Issued on the Tribunal's direction: s 20(6) does not apply.
#ASSERT `Must the person I subpoenaed comply` FALSE (`the date` 2 11 2026) (`the date` 30 11 2026) 7 100 FALSE 0 (`the date` 2 11 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE

